<title>USA: Calif. $242 mln water bonds yield 5.73 pct in 2029.</title>
<headline>Calif. $242 mln water bonds yield 5.73 pct in 2029.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $241.8 million California Department of Water Resources bonds at a top yield of 5.73 percent in 2029.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
